      "content": "While St. John's Wort can help with mood, it's not recommended to take it with birth control pills without consulting a healthcare professional first. St. John's Wort can interact with estrogen-containing birth control pills, potentially causing unpredictable hormone levels, irritability, or other side effects. You may want to discuss alternative herbal options or supplements with a healthcare provider who can assess your individual situation.",
